    "description": "Small, broad, bushy tree, slow-growing to about 3m tall with slightly pendulous branches and feathery, leaves that hang, lay flat or twist - appearing slightly 'wind blown'. Leaves open yellow-green in spring, maturing to bright green, then turning orange and yellow in autumn. Inconspicuous hanging clusters of small, red-purple flowers in spring may be followed by winged purple fruits",
